ase (verified: perTypeKeySuffix(type) already has a\ndefault branch and is what the individual getters delegate to internally) while dropping\nthe switch.\n\nThe no-arg per-type getters above are unchanged and still exist - they're what\nextractDefaults()/keysWithDefaults() reflectively discover (it only invokes zero-arg\ndefault methods; the two-arg overloads were never part of that machinery, before or\nafter this change), so settings key registration is unaffected. Updated the stale\nJavadoc line that described the old delegate-to-getters behavior.\n\nVerified with SystemSettingsTest (26/26 pass), including the round-trip test per\nLATEST_PARTITION_TABLE_TYPES and the default-to-epoch test for both a latest-partition\ntype with no stored value and a non-latest-partition type (ENROLLMENT).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"99a14d50c062416ed3d0bf8828e9f8fb9e56a0e3","tree_id":"62949ff221e8722cf97b3f4554517f655e0f029a","timestamp":"2026-09-02T12:41:18Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos